          "claim": "By the triangle inequality in [F4], $\\alpha|z|=|\\alpha z|=|1-(1-\\alpha z)|\\le1+|1-\\alpha z|$, so $|1-\\alpha z|\\ge\\alpha|z|-1$. Also $|1+cz|\\le1+|c||z|$. Therefore $|R(z)|\\le(1+|c||z|)/(\\alpha|z|-1)^2$ whenever $|z|>1/\\alpha$, and this bound tends to zero as $|z|\\to\\infty$. Together with step 2.1, [F2] gives L-stability.",
